{
  "summary": "This experiment tested an RNA-only model using pca_n2000 encoder in multiprofile settings with avgpool aggregation, isolating its performance compared to scvi_n200 in similar configurations. Validation accuracy of 0.5907 and F1 of 0.5727 are lower than scvi_n200's multiprofile baseline (0.6501), suggesting pca_n2000 may underperform in multiprofile scenarios. The role of aggregation methods and fusion strategies remains uncertain, as well as potential interactions with other design choices."
}

